Table full name: isb-cgc.TCGA_bioclin_v0.Annotations
Column name: entity_type Type: STRING Description: Type of the entity that this annotation applies to; e.g. Shipped Portion, Aliquot, Patient (which has the same meaning as Case), Analyte, etc.
Column name: category Type: STRING Description: Annotation category; one of a relatively short list of phrases from a controlled-vocabulary; e.g. Item is noncanonical, Item flagged DNU, Prior malignancy, etc.
